  - SNOMED-CT
  - ICD-10
  - RxNorm
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  syntha is a Synthea-inspired hybrid synthetic patient record generator.
  It learns the joint distribution of real anonymized Turkish-cohort EHR
  episodes with a Gaussian copula (Spearman→Pearson for continuous pairs,
  polyserial for continuous↔binary pairs, tetrachoric for binary↔binary
  pairs as of v0.5), then layers Synthea-style clinical-pathway modules
  on top to emit fully-coded FHIR R4 transaction bundles in Turkish with
  LOINC, SNOMED CT, ICD-10, and RxNorm coding. Includes a Tauri 2 desktop
  app that runs the sampler entirely client-side.
